# Swift Reconfiguration on Bot1's own Isamaru (a 2/2 Legendary Creature - Dog): it is an artifact Vehicle and no longer a creature
# (CR 205.1a, 613.1d), its legendary supertype stays, and it has crew 5 (CR 702.122a, 613.1f). Crewing is a cost of tapping other
# creatures with total power 5: Sundial (3) and one Memnite (1) make 4 and are refused, Sundial and both Memnites make exactly 5
# and are accepted. The crew effect is later than the Aura's, so until end of turn Isamaru is an artifact creature again with its
# own 2/2 (CR 613.7, 301.7b), and the next turn it is only an artifact Vehicle.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Isamaru, Hound of Konda
Sundial, Dawn Tyrant
Swift Reconfiguration
Memnite
Memnite
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: W)
Bot1.Hand.Isamaru, Hound of Konda.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Sundial, Dawn Tyrant.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Swift Reconfiguration.Cast(Isamaru, Hound of Konda)
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Isamaru, Hound of Konda.Types = Artifact
Bot1.Battlefield.Isamaru, Hound of Konda.Activate(Ability: Crew)
! Bot1.Choose(Sundial, Dawn Tyrant; Memnite#1)
Bot1.Choose(Sundial, Dawn Tyrant; Memnite#1; Memnite#2)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Isamaru, Hound of Konda.Types = Creature; Artifact
? Bot1.Battlefield.Isamaru, Hound of Konda.Power = 2
[T2 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Isamaru, Hound of Konda.Types = Artifact
Bot1.Battlefield.Isamaru, Hound of Konda.Supertypes = Legendary
Bot1.Battlefield.Isamaru, Hound of Konda.Subtypes = Vehicle
Bot1.Battlefield.Sundial, Dawn Tyrant.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite#1.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite#2.Tapped = true
